    "seed.mjs merges these with the scraped data, so they survive re-imports.",
    "Anything added straight into the database instead would be retired on the",
    "next seed.",
    "",
    "Shape matches a series entry in series.json. Leave a field null rather than",
    "guessing — nulls render as '—' and set detail_complete = 0, which the UI",
    "explains. A wrong value looks authoritative and is worse than a gap.",
    "",
    "sourceId uses a 'manual:' prefix so ids stay stable across re-imports",
    "(that's what user collection rows hang off) and never collide with the",
    "source catalogue's own record ids."
